    "Swipe left to pass, swipe right to keep\nThere will be recap at the end" : {
      "comment" : "A description of how to use the app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated" : true
    },
    "Swipe right when a question resonates. Swipe left to pass. Every card is a doorway — open the ones that call to you." : {
